        832,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Patient replies\nEvery text a patient sends lands here. STOP, START, health worries and call-back requests are caught by fixed rules first, so a clinical message never depends on the AI.\n\nEverything else goes to Claude, which only works out what the patient wants: confirm, move, cancel, a question, running late or yes to an open spot. The reply itself comes from tested rules and the real schedule. Moves and cancels free the time for the waitlist straight away, and health concerns text the front desk.",
        "color": 7
      }
    }
